### Agregar punto a una ejecución con referencia existente por locationId — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/addLocation
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "workPlanExecutionId": 1,
  "locationId": 1,
  "radius": 100,
  "minTime": 10,
  "maxTime": 30,
  "minHour": "2026-08-21T08:00:00",
  "maxHour": "2026-08-21T17:00:00"
}

### Agregar punto con referencia existente por privateCode — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/addLocation
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "workPlanExecutionId": 1,
  "privateCode": "REF-EXISTENTE",
  "comments": "Entrega en bodega",
  "minTime": 15,
  "maxTime": 45
}

### Agregar punto creando la referencia (privateCode nuevo + nombre + coordenadas + cliente) — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/addLocation
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "workPlanExecutionId": 1,
  "privateCode": "REF-NUEVA-ADD-001",
  "locationName": "Referencia nueva addLocation",
  "locationAddress": "4a avenida 15-45 zona 10, Guatemala",
  "latitude": 14.6349,
  "longitude": -90.5069,
  "radius": 100,
  "customerPrivateCode": "CLI-001"
}

### Sin token → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/addLocation
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workPlanExecutionId": 1,
  "locationId": 1
}

### Sin workPlanExecutionId (requerido) → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/addLocation
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "locationId": 1,
  "minTime": 10
}

### Ejecución inexistente → 400/500 según manejo del SP
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/addLocation
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "workPlanExecutionId": 999999999,
  "locationId": 1
}

### WD-2553 — Agregar punto con pedidos — 200
### La orden 1001 ya existe y se vincula a la parada; S00042 se resuelve por su despacho.
### El wrapper delega en spWT_Workplans_SaveWorkplanExecutionOrders.
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/addLocation
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "workPlanExecutionId": 1,
  "locationId": 3,
  "radius": 100,
  "orders": [
    { "orderNumber": "S00042", "dispatchNumber": "WH/OUT/00042", "volume": 10 },
    { "orderId": 1001, "volume": 2 }
  ]
}

### WD-2553 — Agregar punto con pedido nuevo (se crea en el catálogo) — 200
### S00099 no existe: se da de alta con Source = WorkplanExecution y se vincula.
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/addLocation
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "workPlanExecutionId": 1,
  "locationId": 3,
  "radius": 100,
  "orders": [
    { "orderNumber": "S00099", "volume": 7 }
  ]
}

### WD-2553 — Sin la clave orders no se tocan los pedidos — 200
### Comportamiento del contrato anterior: solo cambian los campos enviados.
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/addLocation
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "workPlanExecutionId": 1,
  "locationId": 4,
  "radius": 100,
  "minTime": 10
}

### WD-2553 — Pedido ambiguo (venta con dos despachos sin desambiguador) → 400
### El wrapper hace RAISERROR ANTES del upsert, así que la ubicación NO se agrega.
### Esperado: message que empieza con "ambiguousOrders:" y los despachos candidatos.
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/addLocation
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "workPlanExecutionId": 1,
  "locationId": 6,
  "radius": 100,
  "orders": [
    { "orderNumber": "S00042", "volume": 1 }
  ]
}
